==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{PIE word|ru|dʰéǵʰōm}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|землꙗ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*zemľa}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*źémijāˀ}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*dʰéǵʰōm}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|क्षम्}}, {{cog|ae|𐬰𐬀𐬨}}, {{cog|la|humus}}, the source of {{cog|en|human}}; {{cog|grc|χθών}}, {{cog|fa|زمین|tr=zamin}}.

===Pronunciation===
